  "slug": "upgraded-ramen-noodles",
  "title": "Upgraded Ramen Noodles",
  "description": "Almost everyone has eaten ramen at least sometime in their life. But the classic ramen flavor can get a bit boring. That's why I've created these upgraded ramen noodles! These can be made for a lunch for a school day or whatever other meal you like! This recipe is a big enough for a small serving for two or one big serving with enough for a bit of leftovers.*Disclaimer: For this recipe, I didn't use any measurements. You can just eye it and put as much of an ingredient as you like!*Step 1: Boil",
  "date": "2021-05-21T00:43:56.444Z",
  "author": "asustainablefuture0",
  "coverImage": "/static.wixstatic.com/media/e92ca0_7a8efee6018e480f8e92891916a24a89~mv2.jpeg/v1/fill/w_750,h_1000,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01/e92ca0_7a8efee6018e480f8e92891916a24a89~mv2.jpeg",
