  "html": "<p dir=\"auto\"><span>Almost everyone has eaten ramen at least sometime in their life. But the classic ramen flavor can get a bit boring. That's why I've created these upgraded ramen noodles! These can be made for a lunch for a school day or whatever other meal you like! This recipe is a big enough for a small serving for two or one big serving with enough for a bit of leftovers.</span></p>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong><span>*Disclaimer: For this recipe, I didn't use any measurements. You can just eye it and put as much of an ingredient as you like!*</span></strong></p>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span>Step 1: Boil Chicken Broth. The chicken broth gives the noodles an extra kick of flavor that water just doesn't add.</span></p>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<div><div><figure><div><div><img src=\"/static.wixstatic.com/media/e92ca0_7eb2b7ce9c4f4e1eb7eacad1328e96d2~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_2202,h_2936,al_c,q_90/e92ca0_7eb2b7ce9c4f4e1eb7eacad1328e96d2~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"\" draggable=\"false\"></div><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Expand image\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 19 19\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M15.071 8.371V4.585l-4.355 4.356a.2.2 0 0 1-.283 0l-.374-.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0-.283l4.356-4.355h-3.786a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2V3.2c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2H16v5.371a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2h-.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2zm-6.5 6.9v.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2H3v-5.371c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2h.529c.11 0 .2.09.2.2v3.786l4.355-4.356a.2.2 0 0 1 .283 0l.374.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0 .283L4.585 15.07h3.786c.11 0 .2.09.2.2z\" fill=\"#000\" fill-rule=\"nonzero\"></path></svg></button></div></figure></div></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span>Step 2: Chop up some meat. Or any vegetarian alternative. You can use dinner leftovers like turkey, chicken, beef, pork, tofu, etc. Make sure you chop it into small cubes.</span></p>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<div><div><figure><div><div><img src=\"/static.wixstatic.com/media/e92ca0_6b21ae2ec6b44f0ca83d72a68b20450c~mv2.jpeg/v1/fill/w_3024,h_4032,al_c,q_90/e92ca0_6b21ae2ec6b44f0ca83d72a68b20450c~mv2.jpeg\" alt=\"\" draggable=\"false\"></div><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Expand image\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 19 19\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M15.071 8.371V4.585l-4.355 4.356a.2.2 0 0 1-.283 0l-.374-.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0-.283l4.356-4.355h-3.786a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2V3.2c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2H16v5.371a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2h-.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2zm-6.5 6.9v.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2H3v-5.371c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2h.529c.11 0 .2.09.2.2v3.786l4.355-4.356a.2.2 0 0 1 .283 0l.374.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0 .283L4.585 15.07h3.786c.11 0 .2.09.2.2z\" fill=\"#000\" fill-rule=\"nonzero\"></path></svg></button></div></figure></div></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span>Step 3: Heat up the meat/vegetarian alternative. We will add them into the noodles later on but this will make sure that the meat is thoroughly heated. I heated mine up for 1 minute but 30 seconds will also work.</span></p>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<div><div><figure><div><div><img src=\"/static.wixstatic.com/media/e92ca0_96f253f2c50648c3955539400d142aea~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_4032,h_3024,al_c,q_90/e92ca0_96f253f2c50648c3955539400d142aea~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"\" draggable=\"false\"></div><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Expand image\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 19 19\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M15.071 8.371V4.585l-4.355 4.356a.2.2 0 0 1-.283 0l-.374-.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0-.283l4.356-4.355h-3.786a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2V3.2c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2H16v5.371a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2h-.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2zm-6.5 6.9v.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2H3v-5.371c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2h.529c.11 0 .2.09.2.2v3.786l4.355-4.356a.2.2 0 0 1 .283 0l.374.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0 .283L4.585 15.07h3.786c.11 0 .2.09.2.2z\" fill=\"#000\" fill-rule=\"nonzero\"></path></svg></button></div></figure></div></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span>Step 4: Once the broth is boiled, add the ramen noodles. I split mine up into two pieces. If you prefer longer noodles, leave them whole or break it into two pieces. If you like smaller noodles, break them into three or more pieces.</span></p>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<div><div><figure><div><div><img src=\"/static.wixstatic.com/media/e92ca0_8474c789095c4a718d96d66ea43fbc77~mv2.jpeg/v1/fill/w_3024,h_4032,al_c,q_90/e92ca0_8474c789095c4a718d96d66ea43fbc77~mv2.jpeg\" alt=\"\" draggable=\"false\"></div><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Expand image\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 19 19\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M15.071 8.371V4.585l-4.355 4.356a.2.2 0 0 1-.283 0l-.374-.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0-.283l4.356-4.355h-3.786a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2V3.2c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2H16v5.371a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2h-.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2zm-6.5 6.9v.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2H3v-5.371c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2h.529c.11 0 .2.09.2.2v3.786l4.355-4.356a.2.2 0 0 1 .283 0l.374.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0 .283L4.585 15.07h3.786c.11 0 .2.09.2.2z\" fill=\"#000\" fill-rule=\"nonzero\"></path></svg></button></div></figure></div></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span>Step 5: Chop up some leftover vegetables. Here I used a leftover ear of corn. You could use carrots, spinach, broccoli, etc. Make sure you chop these up into nice and small pieces so that you can stir it into the ramen easily.</span></p>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<div><div><figure><div><div><img src=\"/static.wixstatic.com/media/e92ca0_eb5c070aa0c342739b0eb7c67f4ddb51~mv2.jpeg/v1/fill/w_3024,h_4032,al_c,q_90/e92ca0_eb5c070aa0c342739b0eb7c67f4ddb51~mv2.jpeg\" alt=\"\" draggable=\"false\"></div><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Expand image\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 19 19\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M15.071 8.371V4.585l-4.355 4.356a.2.2 0 0 1-.283 0l-.374-.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0-.283l4.356-4.355h-3.786a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2V3.2c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2H16v5.371a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2h-.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2zm-6.5 6.9v.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2H3v-5.371c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2h.529c.11 0 .2.09.2.2v3.786l4.355-4.356a.2.2 0 0 1 .283 0l.374.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0 .283L4.585 15.07h3.786c.11 0 .2.09.2.2z\" fill=\"#000\" fill-rule=\"nonzero\"></path></svg></button></div></figure></div></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span>Step 6: Heat up the vegetables for 30 seconds. Once again, we are doing this to make sure that the vegetables' are heated up thoroughly. </span></p>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<div><div><figure><div><div><img src=\"/static.wixstatic.com/media/e92ca0_a893aba6d01d4959a7364e4056dd0b35~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_4032,h_3024,al_c,q_90/e92ca0_a893aba6d01d4959a7364e4056dd0b35~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"\" draggable=\"false\"></div><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Expand image\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 19 19\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M15.071 8.371V4.585l-4.355 4.356a.2.2 0 0 1-.283 0l-.374-.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0-.283l4.356-4.355h-3.786a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2V3.2c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2H16v5.371a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2h-.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2zm-6.5 6.9v.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2H3v-5.371c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2h.529c.11 0 .2.09.2.2v3.786l4.355-4.356a.2.2 0 0 1 .283 0l.374.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0 .283L4.585 15.07h3.786c.11 0 .2.09.2.2z\" fill=\"#000\" fill-rule=\"nonzero\"></path></svg></button></div></figure></div></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span>Step 7: Once the noodles have softened, add the seasoning packet included in your ramen. Mine was chicken flavor!</span></p>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<div><div><figure><div><div><img src=\"/static.wixstatic.com/media/e92ca0_25e3fec4aeff4be596932f04f23ce0e3~mv2.jpeg/v1/fill/w_3024,h_4032,al_c,q_90/e92ca0_25e3fec4aeff4be596932f04f23ce0e3~mv2.jpeg\" alt=\"\" draggable=\"false\"></div><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Expand image\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 19 19\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M15.071 8.371V4.585l-4.355 4.356a.2.2 0 0 1-.283 0l-.374-.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0-.283l4.356-4.355h-3.786a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2V3.2c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2H16v5.371a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2h-.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2zm-6.5 6.9v.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2H3v-5.371c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2h.529c.11 0 .2.09.2.2v3.786l4.355-4.356a.2.2 0 0 1 .283 0l.374.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0 .283L4.585 15.07h3.786c.11 0 .2.09.2.2z\" fill=\"#000\" fill-rule=\"nonzero\"></path></svg></button></div></figure></div></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span>Step 8: Add butter. The butter makes it creamy and taste wayyyyy better in my opinion.</span></p>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<div><div><figure><div><div><img src=\"/static.wixstatic.com/media/e92ca0_c5748d61825343699553f3c716af9460~mv2.jpeg/v1/fill/w_3024,h_4032,al_c,q_90/e92ca0_c5748d61825343699553f3c716af9460~mv2.jpeg\" alt=\"\" draggable=\"false\"></div><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Expand image\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 19 19\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M15.071 8.371V4.585l-4.355 4.356a.2.2 0 0 1-.283 0l-.374-.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0-.283l4.356-4.355h-3.786a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2V3.2c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2H16v5.371a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2h-.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2zm-6.5 6.9v.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2H3v-5.371c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2h.529c.11 0 .2.09.2.2v3.786l4.355-4.356a.2.2 0 0 1 .283 0l.374.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0 .283L4.585 15.07h3.786c.11 0 .2.09.2.2z\" fill=\"#000\" fill-rule=\"nonzero\"></path></svg></button></div></figure></div></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span>Step 9: Add corn and meat.</span></p>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<div><div><figure><div><div><img src=\"/static.wixstatic.com/media/e92ca0_f18afd37552e46a282a5c48f349bf902~mv2.jpeg/v1/fill/w_3024,h_4032,al_c,q_90/e92ca0_f18afd37552e46a282a5c48f349bf902~mv2.jpeg\" alt=\"\" draggable=\"false\"></div><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Expand image\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 19 19\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M15.071 8.371V4.585l-4.355 4.356a.2.2 0 0 1-.283 0l-.374-.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0-.283l4.356-4.355h-3.786a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2V3.2c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2H16v5.371a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2h-.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2zm-6.5 6.9v.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2H3v-5.371c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2h.529c.11 0 .2.09.2.2v3.786l4.355-4.356a.2.2 0 0 1 .283 0l.374.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0 .283L4.585 15.07h3.786c.11 0 .2.09.2.2z\" fill=\"#000\" fill-rule=\"nonzero\"></path></svg></button></div></figure></div></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span>Step 10: </span><strong><span>Optional</span></strong><span> Add frozen greens. I know, i know. Greens!? Ramen is comfort food not healthy food! Well, the greens add a little something to the ramen. You don't really taste it much so it also acts as a garnish. Make sure to stir afterwards!</span></p>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<div><div><figure><div><div><img src=\"/static.wixstatic.com/media/e92ca0_5cb359a0762f4c5b8a95a56796151870~mv2.jpeg/v1/fill/w_3024,h_4032,al_c,q_90/e92ca0_5cb359a0762f4c5b8a95a56796151870~mv2.jpeg\" alt=\"\" draggable=\"false\"></div><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Expand image\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 19 19\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M15.071 8.371V4.585l-4.355 4.356a.2.2 0 0 1-.283 0l-.374-.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0-.283l4.356-4.355h-3.786a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2V3.2c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2H16v5.371a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2h-.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2zm-6.5 6.9v.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2H3v-5.371c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2h.529c.11 0 .2.09.2.2v3.786l4.355-4.356a.2.2 0 0 1 .283 0l.374.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0 .283L4.585 15.07h3.786c.11 0 .2.09.2.2z\" fill=\"#000\" fill-rule=\"nonzero\"></path></svg></button></div></figure></div></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span>Step 11: Add cheddar cheese. I know, another shocking ingredient. But trust me on this one, it tastes soooo good in ramen. Just do it. Do it. DO IT!</span></p>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<div><div><figure><div><div><img src=\"/static.wixstatic.com/media/e92ca0_144d674a865741549c990f8fce2c8d4e~mv2.jpeg/v1/fill/w_3024,h_4032,al_c,q_90/e92ca0_144d674a865741549c990f8fce2c8d4e~mv2.jpeg\" alt=\"\" draggable=\"false\"></div><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Expand image\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 19 19\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M15.071 8.371V4.585l-4.355 4.356a.2.2 0 0 1-.283 0l-.374-.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0-.283l4.356-4.355h-3.786a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2V3.2c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2H16v5.371a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2h-.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2zm-6.5 6.9v.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2H3v-5.371c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2h.529c.11 0 .2.09.2.2v3.786l4.355-4.356a.2.2 0 0 1 .283 0l.374.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0 .283L4.585 15.07h3.786c.11 0 .2.09.2.2z\" fill=\"#000\" fill-rule=\"nonzero\"></path></svg></button></div></figure></div></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span>Step 12: Final mix! That's right guys! We're done! Enjoy and bon appetit!</span></p>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<div><div><figure><div><div><img src=\"/static.wixstatic.com/media/e92ca0_7a8efee6018e480f8e92891916a24a89~mv2.jpeg/v1/fill/w_3024,h_4032,al_c,q_90/e92ca0_7a8efee6018e480f8e92891916a24a89~mv2.jpeg\" alt=\"\" draggable=\"false\"></div><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Expand image\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 19 19\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M15.071 8.371V4.585l-4.355 4.356a.2.2 0 0 1-.283 0l-.374-.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0-.283l4.356-4.355h-3.786a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2V3.2c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2H16v5.371a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2h-.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2zm-6.5 6.9v.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2H3v-5.371c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2h.529c.11 0 .2.09.2.2v3.786l4.355-4.356a.2.2 0 0 1 .283 0l.374.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0 .283L4.585 15.07h3.786c.11 0 .2.09.2.2z\" fill=\"#000\" fill-rule=\"nonzero\"></path></svg></button></div></figure></div></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>"
}
